{"title":"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the degree measure of an angle whose complement is 25% of its supplement.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/e/0ee02226ff822d7d9eed47ab9889ea4c9dd44541.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 48 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ 60 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 75 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 120 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 150 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"405\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can create an equation for the question, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4baa9f751aed7af4ddb2a9a19bb0766410c531da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4(90-x)=(180-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff0200a872d5740d804878df3915ee3f927b59e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360-4x=180-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"152\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/e/01eee9bb63c2db132f15fca860bccb9eebb2a1b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x=180$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>After simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0ab15c972639c76d5d069783f54c8b4a23a7e17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=60 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm {(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Given that the complementary angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the supplementary angle. Subtracting the complementary angle from the supplementary angle, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> of the supplementary angle.\n</p><p>Thus the degree measure of the supplementary angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b49fcb2f74ccae5ec0e722a8c65b5b9bbd93720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, and the degree measure of the desired angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/538444476d010110412380c09e3c685a1c9dee92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ} - 120^{\\circ} = 60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"140\" height=\"13\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/9/c193f85b4bf56904b8975fd4322bf60faa9ec718.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm {(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A\">2002 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017200419\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 155/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2126/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.957      1 -total\n 58.99%    7.644      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.64%    5.006      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5576:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017200419 and revision id 109079. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}